	)
	(text "RF MODULATION INJECTION — BIAS-TEE (per channel)  |  Copy into DFBLaser.kicad_sch\nMOD1_DRV (from AD9833 sine, ~0.6 Vpk, Omega ~2 MHz) -> C_ac(DC block) -> R_inj(depth trim) -> C_bt(DC block) -> laser-line node\nL_bt presents high-Z at Omega (X_L~126R @2MHz) so RF current flows into the laser, not back to the FET/supply; passes DC.\nLAS1_DCFEED is the existing DC laser feed (FET drain side / supply through L_bt). LAS1_TOLASER goes to the DFB laser anode.\nStart values: L_bt=10uH (SRF>>20MHz), C_bt=10nF C0G, R_inj=2k (trim 1k-5k), C_ac=100nF. I_pk ~ Vsrc/R_inj ~ 0.3mA.\nFLAG: FM efficiency falls at MHz (carrier-dominated). Final depth & Omega await measured FM response (open item 1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.192 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
